---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — TaleemMarkaz | No tracking, no ads, no data sales';
const description = 'TaleemMarkaz privacy policy. We do not track students, run ads, or sell data. Read exactly what little we collect and your rights under it.';

const jsonLd = [
  { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'WebPage', name: 'Privacy Policy — TaleemMarkaz', url: 'https://taleemmarkaz.com/privacy/', description },
  { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'BreadcrumbList', itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://taleemmarkaz.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Privacy Policy' }
  ]}
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <section class="border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 py-16 sm:px-7 lg:px-10 lg:py-20">
      <nav class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
        <a href={url('/')} class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="text-slate-500">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        TaleemMarkaz ("we", "us", "our") built this platform for Pakistani students. We respect your privacy deeply and keep this policy deliberately short: <strong>we don't track you, we don't run ads, and we don't sell your data.</strong> Here's exactly what that means.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 py-12 sm:px-7 lg:px-10">
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:font-extrabold prose-h3:text-xl prose-h3:font-extrabold">

      <h2>1. Our privacy philosophy</h2>
      <p>Most educational websites quietly build advertising profiles of students. TaleemMarkaz does not. We believe students studying for board exams should never have to pay for that access with their behavioural data. Our business model is simple: keep the library free, keep it fast, and leave you alone.</p>

      <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>When you browse the site:</strong> Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) logs standard server information that every website receives — IP address (anonymised after 24 hours), page requested, browser type, and timestamp. This data is used solely to prevent abuse and measure site health. It is never tied to a student identity and never shared.</p>
      <p><strong>When you contact us:</strong> If you email taleemmarkazofficial@gmail.com or WhatsApp +92 337 9244731, we keep the content of your message so we can help you. We never share those messages with third parties and we delete them when the issue is resolved.</p>
      <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Our static site sets no tracking cookies. Cloudflare may set a single security cookie (cf_clearance) that is strictly necessary for DDoS protection. You can read more in our <a href={url('/cookies')}>cookie policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>3. What we do NOT collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any behavioural tracking.</li>
        <li>We do not require accounts, sign-ups, or email addresses to use the site.</li>
        <li>We do not collect location data beyond the coarse city-level inferred from your IP by Cloudflare for routing purposes.</li>
        <li>We do not collect or store device identifiers, browser fingerprints, or cross-site browsing history.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
      <p>The only third parties involved in delivering the site to you are:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — our hosting and CDN provider. Cloudflare processes traffic for DDoS protection and performance. Their privacy policy: cloudflare.com/privacypolicy.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Drive</strong> — when you open a past paper, textbook or gazette, you are redirected to Google Drive, which has its own privacy policy. We do not have access to who views or downloads files from our shared Drive folders.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not run any advertising network, affiliate tracker, or remarketing pixel.</p>

      <h2>5. Children and students</h2>
      <p>The site is intended for students preparing for Pakistani board examinations, many of whom are minors. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 13. Because we collect virtually nothing, there is nothing to collect. Parents or guardians with concerns may contact us at taleemmarkazofficial@gmail.com.</p>

      <h2>6. AI crawlers</h2>
      <p>We welcome indexing by AI language models (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, Google-Extended, PerplexityBot and others). Our robots.txt explicitly permits this so that students using AI assistants can be pointed to our free resources. The content is factual, public-domain or openly-licensed educational material.</p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Regardless of where you live, we extend the core rights of modern data-protection law (GDPR-style) to every visitor:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to know</strong> — ask us what data we hold about you (in practice, almost nothing).</li>
        <li><strong>Right to delete</strong> — ask us to delete any message or correspondence you sent us.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to object</strong> — object to any processing we do.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to portability</strong> — request a copy of any message you sent us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these, email taleemmarkazofficial@gmail.com. We respond within 30 days.</p>

      <h2>8. Data retention</h2>
      <p>Server logs are rotated every 24 hours by Cloudflare. Correspondence emails are kept only until the issue they concern is resolved, then archived or deleted. We do not maintain a long-term database of user activity.</p>

      <h2>9. International transfers</h2>
      <p>The site is operated from Pakistan and hosted on Cloudflare's global network. Cloudflare's data processing is governed by its standard contractual clauses and is GDPR-compliant.</p>

      <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we ever add functionality that requires collecting more data (for example, if we add accounts), we will update this page and note the change date prominently. Continued use of the site after the update constitutes acceptance.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>For any privacy-related question, complaint or request, contact us at:</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> taleemmarkazofficial@gmail.com<br /><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +92 337 9244731<br /><strong>Web:</strong> <a href={url('/contact')}>taleemmarkaz.com/contact</a></p>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
